```text
TRAINING / DISCOVERY SIDE
-------------------------

Genomic input                         Metadata input
(VCF / matrix)                        (labels: group, phenotype,
                                      AMR profile, terminal endpoint)
      │                                       │
      │                                       │
      ▼                                       ▼
Clean genomic matrix                   Supervised labels
sample × genomic features              sample → target label(s)
      │                                       │
      │                                       │
      └────────────────┬──────────────────────┘
                       ▼
          Sample / metadata alignment
          retain samples with both:
          valid genomic features + valid labels
                       │
                       ▼
        Central statistical feature filtering
        χ²-FDR / Fisher-FDR / RF-FDR /
        permutation-FDR
                       │
                       ▼
              Filtered matrix
      only statistically retained genomic features
      continue into downstream modelling
                       │
                       ▼
        Ranked feature-panel separability check
        evaluate compact top-N feature panels
        from the statistically filtered feature set
                       │
                       ▼
             Model-ready feature panel
      compact selected matrix for training and querying
                       │
                       ▼
        Level 1 / Level 2 / recursive hierarchy training
        Level 1: strain / lineage / group placement
        Level 2+: AMR phenotype / resistance profile /
                  terminal endpoint prediction
                       │
                       ▼
        Per-node model training and fallback handling
        train branch-specific models where support is sufficient
        record skipped / deterministic / fallback nodes explicitly
                       │
                       ▼
       Selected feature lists saved in registry
       per trained level / node / fallback model
                       │
                       ▼
        Selected-feature manifest saved
        ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐
        │ Feature_ID                                 │
        │ genomic position / contig                  │
        │ REF allele                                 │
        │ ALT allele                                 │
        │ baseline allele                            │
        │ encoding rule                              │
        │ context sequence around marker             │
        │ marker-centre offset                       │
        │ gene / region annotation                   │
        │ trained level / hierarchy node             │
        │ parent branch / model route                │
        │ feature source: central filter + panel     │
        └────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                       │
                       ▼
              Query-ready model registry
        ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐
        │ trained model files                        │
        │ selected features per model                │
        │ selected-feature manifests                 │
        │ hierarchy structure                        │
        │ fallback model records                     │
        │ label encoders / class mappings            │
        │ training configuration summary             │
        │ feature-filtering summaries                │
        │ feature-panel summaries                    │
        └────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                       │
                       ▼
        Optional portable model bundle
        registry + models + selected-marker metadata


QUERY / INFERENCE SIDE
----------------------

New query sample
(matrix, VCF, raw FASTA sequence, or FASTQ reads)
                       │
                       ▼
        If FASTQ query:
        FASTQ → alignment → sorted BAM → VCF
        then continue through the VCF query route
                       │
                       ▼
          Load saved model registry / bundle
          "Which trained models exist?"
          "Which hierarchy route should be followed?"
          "Which selected features does each model need?"
                       │
                       ▼
          Load selected-feature manifest
          "What does each feature mean biologically?"
          "How should each feature be reconstructed?"
                       │
                       ▼
        Build query feature representation
        depending on query input type:

        Matrix query:
          align query columns to trained selected features

        VCF query:
          recover trained marker states from query VCF

        FASTA query:
          map saved context sequence to query DNA
                       │
                       ▼
        For raw FASTA query:
        extract nucleotide at marker centre
                       │
                       ▼
        Compare observed nucleotide with:
        REF / ALT / baseline allele from manifest
                       │
                       ▼
        Encode using the same training rule
        baseline match = 0
        known non-baseline / ALT match = 1
        unresolved or missing trained marker = 0 with warning
                       │
                       ▼
        Build one-sample selected-feature matrix
        same columns and order expected by trained model
                       │
                       ▼
        Apply saved Level 1 model
        strain / lineage / group placement
                       │
                       ▼
        Select next model from registry
        branch-specific Level 2 model if available
        otherwise configured global / terminal fallback
                       │
                       ▼
        Apply saved Level 2 or recursive hierarchy model
        AMR phenotype / resistance-profile /
        terminal endpoint prediction
                       │
                       ▼
        Marker-evidence audit
        ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐
        │ resolved active marker evidence            │
        │ resolved baseline marker evidence          │
        │ missing trained features filled as 0       │
        │ unresolved context / allele calls          │
        │ query coverage against selected features   │
        │ branch-specific marker recovery            │
        └────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                       │
                       ▼
        Prediction report + marker evidence report
        ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐
        │ predicted route                            │
        │ predicted label / terminal endpoint        │
        │ model support / confidence-like support    │
        │ marker recovery summary                    │
        │ alignment summary                          │
        │ fallback / skipped-node audit              │
        │ compact TSV / CSV / JSON / HTML outputs    │
        └────────────────────────────────────────────┘


VALIDATION / REPORTING SIDE
---------------------------

Saved predictions + labelled metadata
                       │
                       ▼
        Evaluation without retraining
        no statistical filtering, model fitting,
        or feature selection is rerun here
                       │
                       ▼
        Performance diagnostics
        ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐
        │ balanced accuracy                          │
        │ sensitivity / specificity                  │
        │ precision / PPV                            │
        │ NPV                                        │
        │ macro / weighted F1                        │
        │ confusion matrix                           │
        │ branch-level hierarchy diagnostics         │
        └────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                       │
                       ▼
        Optional leakage-aware repeated CV
        split first → filter inside training fold →
        select panel inside training fold →
        train inside training fold →
        evaluate held-out fold
                       │
                       ▼
        Robust inference summaries
        fold-wise performance + feature stability


NETWORK / GNN OUTPUT SIDE
-------------------------

Selected feature panels + trained registry + query evidence
                       │
                       ▼
        Network-ready outputs
        ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐
        │ ranked selected marker table               │
        │ sample-feature matrix                      │
        │ marker membership per trained level/node   │
        │ feature overlap between hierarchy levels   │
        │ sample-feature network                     │
        │ feature adjacency matrix                   │
        │ sample-feature adjacency matrix            │
        │ node metadata for downstream GNN use       │
        └────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```
